ATP fixture for VMC-ATP-014. Test instrumentation, not part of the product.

After every inventory change, the server log gets one line per player:
  ATP inventory player=<name> slots=[(<slot>, "<item>", <count>), ...] cursor_item=... cursor_count=<n>
Slots: 9-35 main inventory (rows from top-left), 36-44 hotbar (from left), 45 offhand.

Apply at the repository root:   git apply tools/atp/patches/<this file>
Remove it after the test:       git apply -R tools/atp/patches/<this file>

